WEBVTT

00:00:05.770 --> 00:00:08.570
She's compatible with Gungnir?

00:00:11.050 --> 00:00:12.120
Bikky...

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:13.960
Tachibana-san really is...

00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:14.990
...saving people.

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:18.630
Not here...

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:24.080
Not here...

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:26.810
It won't end here!

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:31.920
Dr. Ver!

00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:38.180
Hibiki-san, that Symphogear...

00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:42.150
Maria-san's Gungnir answered my song.

00:00:44.260 --> 00:00:45.170
What's this?

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:54.650
<b>Episode 13 
In the Distance, That Day... 
When the Star Became Music</b>

00:00:53.090 --> 00:00:54.650
Detecting irregularities in the gravity field!

00:00:54.960 --> 00:00:57.450
Frontier has started to move and gain altitude.

00:00:59.860 --> 00:01:01.200
Ver has linked

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:04.490
his left arm to Frontier,

00:01:04.820 --> 00:01:06.870
and can control it as he wants.

00:01:07.530 --> 00:01:09.910
Even without the Staff of Solomon,

00:01:09.910 --> 00:01:12.180
I still have Frontier.

00:01:13.060 --> 00:01:14.800
I'll use gravity waves

00:01:15.070 --> 00:01:18.450
to rip those who oppose me off the ground!

00:01:19.440 --> 00:01:22.700
Frontier gets its power from Nephilim's heart.

00:01:23.460 --> 00:01:26.810
If you can shut that down, you can stop Ver.

00:01:27.490 --> 00:01:28.410
Please.

00:01:29.120 --> 00:01:31.720
I have no right to fight. So in my place...

00:01:32.440 --> 00:01:33.400
Please!

00:01:33.950 --> 00:01:36.490
Shirabe-chan asked me to do it, too.

00:01:37.460 --> 00:01:39.600
She wanted me to save you.

00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:41.740
So don't worry!

00:01:45.850 --> 00:01:46.870
Master!

00:01:48.450 --> 00:01:51.060
Leave tracking Dr. Ver to us.

00:01:51.530 --> 00:01:52.630
I want you to...

00:01:52.630 --> 00:01:55.130
I'll stop the Nephilim's heart!

00:01:56.110 --> 00:01:56.760
Let's go.

00:01:56.760 --> 00:01:57.380
Right.

00:01:59.220 --> 00:02:01.970
Just wait... I'll be right back.

00:02:16.780 --> 00:02:18.600
Tsubasa-san! Chris-chan!

00:02:18.600 --> 00:02:19.450
Tachibana!

00:02:19.690 --> 00:02:22.200
I won't slow us down anymore, so...

00:02:22.440 --> 00:02:24.580
Yes, let's fight together.

00:02:24.580 --> 00:02:25.590
Right!

00:02:26.760 --> 00:02:28.490
You did it, Chris-chan!

00:02:28.490 --> 00:02:31.380
I had faith you'd bring it back!

00:02:31.680 --> 00:02:33.520
Of course I did.

00:02:35.850 --> 00:02:37.310
HQ's analysis has pinpointed

00:02:37.310 --> 00:02:40.130
the location of a high-mass energy output!

00:02:40.520 --> 00:02:43.130
It's probably Frontier's reactor,

00:02:43.130 --> 00:02:44.760
its heart!

00:02:45.140 --> 00:02:48.630
Wielders, head there immediately, 
as directed by HQ!

00:02:49.080 --> 00:02:49.770
Let's go.

00:02:50.190 --> 00:02:52.480
We are the only ones with

00:02:52.480 --> 00:02:54.770
spears, bows, and swords here.

00:03:00.020 --> 00:03:03.570
Stray cats, running around my yard,

00:03:03.570 --> 00:03:05.750
feel the power of the Nephilim that

00:03:05.750 --> 00:03:09.330
devoured and assimilated Frontier!

00:03:12.710 --> 00:03:14.120
Wh-What?

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:17.840
At this point, it doesn't matter what comes.

00:03:31.660 --> 00:03:34.980
That autonomous, completed relic we saw before?

00:03:39.230 --> 00:03:41.360
It's awfully fired-up for that! {D: TC - for being that relic?}

00:03:42.130 --> 00:03:43.370
Devour them...

00:03:43.670 --> 00:03:45.990
Devour everything that gets in my way.

00:03:46.220 --> 00:03:50.200
Demonstrate the power they called "the glutton,"

00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:53.120
Nephilim!

00:03:56.050 --> 00:03:58.670
There's nothing I can do.

00:03:59.600 --> 00:04:01.170
Serena's songs...

00:04:02.610 --> 00:04:06.260
I'm wasting them, along with her death.

00:04:07.690 --> 00:04:09.110
Maria-neesan...

00:04:11.400 --> 00:04:12.480
Serena?

00:04:13.170 --> 00:04:15.740
What is it you want to do?

00:04:18.420 --> 00:04:20.960
I want to save the world with my songs.

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:24.270
I want to save everyone from the disaster

00:04:24.270 --> 00:04:26.070
caused by the falling Moon.

00:04:30.920 --> 00:04:34.700
Don't hide the feelings that were born within you.

00:04:35.020 --> 00:04:35.960
Serena...

00:04:38.320 --> 00:04:47.220
<i>The apple floated in the sky.</i>

00:04:47.630 --> 00:04:55.850
<i>The apple fell down to the ground.</i>

00:04:56.120 --> 00:05:00.650
<i>The stars were born.</i>

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:05.260
<i>The songs were born.</i>

00:05:05.260 --> 00:05:14.250
<i>The Lulu Amel smiled for eternity.</i>

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:19.000
<i>The stars kissed.</i>

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:23.520
<i>The songs slept.</i>

00:05:25.250 --> 00:05:32.820
<i>Where will they call home?</i>

00:05:27.550 --> 00:05:30.160
Phonic gain from all over the world

00:05:30.160 --> 00:05:33.520
is being sent here, via Frontier.

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:42.770
<i>Where will they call home?</i>

00:05:34.420 --> 00:05:37.020
With all this phonic gain,

00:05:37.570 --> 00:05:39.950
it's possible to restart the lunar ruins,

00:05:39.950 --> 00:05:42.770
and adjust the Moon's orbit.

00:05:42.770 --> 00:05:45.010
<i>The apple...</i>

00:05:44.350 --> 00:05:46.330
Maria! Maria!

00:05:46.670 --> 00:05:47.530
Mom!

00:05:49.530 --> 00:05:52.910
The entire world is resonating with your song.

00:05:53.590 --> 00:05:55.940
This much phonic gain is

00:05:55.940 --> 00:05:58.750
sufficient to activate the lunar ruins!

00:05:59.650 --> 00:06:02.670
I shall take responsibility for stopping the Moon.

00:06:03.480 --> 00:06:04.490
Mom!

00:06:05.070 --> 00:06:08.080
There is nothing left to bind you.

00:06:08.940 --> 00:06:10.930
Go, Maria.

00:06:11.260 --> 00:06:14.820
Go, and let me hear your songs.

00:06:15.120 --> 00:06:15.950
Mom...

00:06:19.210 --> 00:06:20.940
Okay, Mom.

00:06:23.480 --> 00:06:26.690
It's time for the curtain to rise on 
the greatest show in the world!

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:38.120
Then take it all!

00:06:46.300 --> 00:06:47.050
Yukine!

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:50.590
Tsubasa-san!

00:06:58.500 --> 00:06:59.520
Death!

00:07:07.200 --> 00:07:10.240
Shul Shagana and Igalima are here!

00:07:10.480 --> 00:07:11.830
You guys came?

00:07:13.040 --> 00:07:13.870
But it's going

00:07:14.490 --> 00:07:16.370
to be a challenge

00:07:16.370 --> 00:07:18.580
to deal with this thing.

00:07:18.810 --> 00:07:20.210
But we have our songs!

00:07:24.220 --> 00:07:25.130
Maria...

00:07:25.260 --> 00:07:26.000
Maria!

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:31.590
Maria-san!

00:07:32.540 --> 00:07:33.850
I won't hesitate anymore.

00:07:34.390 --> 00:07:37.140
Mom is risking her life

00:07:37.140 --> 00:07:39.350
to stop the Moon from falling.

00:07:39.920 --> 00:07:42.590
Even all you failures coming together

00:07:42.590 --> 00:07:44.480
can't change my advantage!

00:07:44.830 --> 00:07:47.730
Burn them to a crisp, Nephilim!

00:08:03.670 --> 00:08:11.180
<i>Seilien coffin Airgetlám tron.</i>

00:08:26.780 --> 00:08:28.270
<i>Shirabe is here.</i>

00:08:28.660 --> 00:08:29.870
<i>Kirika is here.</i>

00:08:30.700 --> 00:08:33.110
<i>Mom and Serena are with me, too.</i>

00:08:34.380 --> 00:08:37.270
<i>If everyone is here, a miracle like this...</i>

00:08:37.830 --> 00:08:39.260
is nothing!

00:08:39.580 --> 00:08:44.670
<i>Souls entrusted.</i>

00:08:42.580 --> 00:08:45.330
They used the energy from equipping 
their Gears as a barrier field?

00:08:44.670 --> 00:08:49.220
<i>Souls connected.</i>

00:08:45.710 --> 00:08:49.710
But that trick won't last long!

00:08:49.220 --> 00:08:54.420
<i>A light takes flight to the heavens,</i>

00:08:51.980 --> 00:08:53.720
<i>Set Harmonics!</i>

00:08:54.420 --> 00:08:59.970
<i>drawn on the string of a bow.</i>

00:08:54.970 --> 00:08:56.050
<i>S2CA!</i>

00:08:56.440 --> 00:08:59.970
Turn phonic gain into power!

00:09:02.020 --> 00:09:07.220
<i>Bringing together a billion loves,</i>

00:09:03.110 --> 00:09:06.150
When melodies are drawn together, 
there's no need for reasons.

00:09:07.220 --> 00:09:12.190
<i>we bring together time.</i>

00:09:12.190 --> 00:09:17.410
<i>Now we return to the song of the heartbeat</i>

00:09:12.690 --> 00:09:15.280
Guess there's no hope for me, either.

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:17.410
That goes for both of us.

00:09:17.410 --> 00:09:23.120
<i>that began everything.</i>

00:09:19.680 --> 00:09:21.620
Shirabe-chan! Kirika-chan!

00:09:25.760 --> 00:09:30.700
<i>Souls creating.</i>

00:09:26.340 --> 00:09:29.910
I want to believe that what 
you're doing isn't hypocrisy.

00:09:30.700 --> 00:09:32.920
So show us up close what you mean

00:09:30.920 --> 00:09:35.400
<i>Held in arms.</i>

00:09:33.240 --> 00:09:36.470
when you talk about saving people.

00:09:35.400 --> 00:09:40.570
<i>Strong like the Sun.</i>

00:09:40.570 --> 00:09:46.440
<i>Kind like the Moon.</i>

00:09:46.440 --> 00:09:51.160
<i>The future suddenly appears.</i>

00:09:48.330 --> 00:09:50.840
<i>Something only clasped hands can create...</i>

00:09:51.160 --> 00:09:57.580
<i>The story moves to its ending.</i>

00:09:51.820 --> 00:09:53.690
Six Climax Songs...

00:09:53.910 --> 00:09:55.970
You think a mere six is

00:09:55.970 --> 00:09:58.370
going to be enough?!

00:09:57.580 --> 00:10:03.830
<i>And it will bloom again.</i>

00:10:03.830 --> 00:10:10.330
<i>A miracle will soon become history,</i>

00:10:06.330 --> 00:10:08.000
<i>It isn't just six.</i>

00:10:08.500 --> 00:10:11.000
I'm bringing together

00:10:10.330 --> 00:10:15.880
<i>shining and proud!</i>

00:10:11.520 --> 00:10:15.880
seven billion Climax Songs!

00:10:15.880 --> 00:10:21.390
<i>Bringing together a billion loves,</i>

00:10:21.390 --> 00:10:26.310
<i>we bring together time.</i>

00:10:25.380 --> 00:10:28.310
These Symphogears were given to us

00:10:26.310 --> 00:10:31.510
<i>A miracle will soon become history,</i>

00:10:29.140 --> 00:10:33.140
by everyone's songs!

00:10:31.510 --> 00:10:38.630
<i>shining and proud!</i>

00:10:52.960 --> 00:10:54.170
What?

00:10:54.830 --> 00:10:55.900
Dr. Ver!

00:10:56.990 --> 00:10:59.810
Looks like the world was a bit too big for you.

00:11:05.350 --> 00:11:06.560
<b>Shadow Weave</b>

00:11:09.240 --> 00:11:11.270
I won't let you.

00:11:11.270 --> 00:11:14.580
If a miracle is the reward for trying your hardest,

00:11:14.880 --> 00:11:17.190
then I'm the one who deserves a miracle!

00:11:19.850 --> 00:11:20.860
What did you do?

00:11:21.140 --> 00:11:22.440
Just one word...

00:11:22.830 --> 00:11:26.330
I ordered it to purge the Nephilim's heart.

00:11:27.600 --> 00:11:30.960
The Nephilim's heart has gone out of my control.

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:33.290
It will devour Frontier's hull,

00:11:33.290 --> 00:11:36.240
and use it to fuel its rampage.

00:11:36.240 --> 00:11:38.590
The energy it unleashes will be

00:11:38.590 --> 00:11:40.090
a trillion degrees!

00:11:43.590 --> 00:11:46.320
If I can't be a hero in this world,

00:11:46.320 --> 00:11:48.090
let it all burn up—

00:11:52.850 --> 00:11:56.130
Looks like breaking it won't help.

00:11:58.270 --> 00:11:59.230
Understood.

00:11:59.770 --> 00:12:02.020
We'll deal with it before it goes critical.

00:12:11.760 --> 00:12:14.290
Taking me prisoner? Like you've got time.

00:12:14.620 --> 00:12:17.170
It'd be easier to just kill me.

00:12:23.500 --> 00:12:24.980
I won't kill you.

00:12:25.770 --> 00:12:28.990
I won't let you be a demon that destroyed the world,

00:12:28.990 --> 00:12:31.930
or a hero who died for his ideals.

00:12:32.530 --> 00:12:35.870
You're going to be judged, just like 
a normal human being!

00:12:37.480 --> 00:12:38.800
Damn it!

00:12:38.800 --> 00:12:41.440
Kill me! Make me a hero!

00:12:41.830 --> 00:12:45.200
Make me a hero!

00:13:02.080 --> 00:13:03.520
Fujitaka, you're up.

00:13:03.520 --> 00:13:04.800
I'm too busy.

00:13:05.020 --> 00:13:06.180
No whining!

00:13:16.410 --> 00:13:17.540
Look at that!

00:13:17.980 --> 00:13:20.420
That's why the commander was talking about...

00:13:23.330 --> 00:13:27.050
The Nephilim's regenerating heart...

00:13:44.920 --> 00:13:46.800
<b>Final Type Omega Dystopia</b>

00:13:50.100 --> 00:13:52.010
<b>Final Punishment: Neverland</b>

00:14:01.330 --> 00:14:05.190
It doesn't only eat relics. It eats their energy?

00:14:05.630 --> 00:14:07.830
If it reaches criticality, Earth will...

00:14:07.830 --> 00:14:09.060
It'll burn up!

00:14:09.820 --> 00:14:13.700
<i>Babylonia: Full Open!</i>

00:14:17.900 --> 00:14:19.720
The Treasury of Babylonia?!

00:14:19.720 --> 00:14:22.320
She expanded the Staff of Solomon's capabilities

00:14:22.320 --> 00:14:23.940
with her X-Drive output?

00:14:25.240 --> 00:14:28.430
If we can get the Nephilim beyond the gate,

00:14:28.430 --> 00:14:30.320
and into the Treasury of Babylonia...

00:14:31.150 --> 00:14:33.520
Show me you can do more

00:14:33.520 --> 00:14:37.010
than just kill, Solomon!

00:14:40.190 --> 00:14:41.440
This'll work!

00:14:43.360 --> 00:14:44.610
Dodge, Yukine!

00:14:48.960 --> 00:14:52.320
For tomorrow!

00:14:59.650 --> 00:15:00.420
Maria!

00:15:06.960 --> 00:15:10.270
After it's inside, I'll seal the gate from within!

00:15:10.270 --> 00:15:11.840
I'll take care of the Nephilim!

00:15:11.840 --> 00:15:13.930
You're going to sacrifice yourself?

00:15:13.930 --> 00:15:15.470
Maria!

00:15:17.130 --> 00:15:20.910
There's no way this will atone for my sins...

00:15:21.810 --> 00:15:25.710
But I can protect all lives, everywhere.

00:15:25.710 --> 00:15:26.970
In that case,

00:15:27.610 --> 00:15:31.610
we'll protect your life, okay?

00:15:36.940 --> 00:15:38.340
You all...

00:15:44.410 --> 00:15:48.400
I'm not a hero, so I can't protect the world.

00:15:49.350 --> 00:15:51.130
But we...

00:15:51.880 --> 00:15:53.390
We...

00:15:54.500 --> 00:15:56.080
We aren't alone.

00:16:08.670 --> 00:16:09.650
Hibiki!

00:16:10.010 --> 00:16:11.280
Brace for impact!

00:16:18.480 --> 00:16:20.660
Phonic gain is maintaining output.

00:16:23.240 --> 00:16:25.750
The lunar ruins, the Curse of Balal...

00:16:25.750 --> 00:16:28.300
Control systems reactivated.

00:16:28.550 --> 00:16:31.240
Initiating readjustment of lunar orbit.

00:16:33.790 --> 00:16:36.900
<i>Please let me hear you...</i>

00:16:36.900 --> 00:16:39.450
<i>Because I'm here.</i>

00:16:37.300 --> 00:16:38.230
The star...

00:16:38.230 --> 00:16:40.160
<i>...becomes music.</i>

00:16:39.450 --> 00:16:44.140
<i>Don't hide your newborn feelings!</i>

00:16:44.140 --> 00:16:49.870
<i>Melodies drawn together don't need a reason.</i>

00:16:47.060 --> 00:16:49.870
Go!

00:16:49.870 --> 00:16:56.840
<i>Passionate emotions piercing the heavens!</i>

00:16:57.090 --> 00:16:59.820
<i>True Song!</i>

00:16:59.950 --> 00:17:01.700
Take this!

00:17:07.580 --> 00:17:09.460
Shirabe! Is it done yet?

00:17:07.580 --> 00:17:10.230
<i>When did it start, like breathing?</i>

00:17:10.230 --> 00:17:12.880
<i>Why, I wonder, did I start to seek you.</i>

00:17:10.630 --> 00:17:12.880
Just a little more!

00:17:12.880 --> 00:17:17.720
<i>My broken heart starts to ache, 
starts to cry. Start it up!</i>

00:17:14.870 --> 00:17:15.870
Maria!

00:17:15.870 --> 00:17:17.720
A single staff can't

00:17:17.720 --> 00:17:20.400
<i>The overflowing noise always</i>

00:17:18.110 --> 00:17:21.220
control this many at once!

00:17:20.400 --> 00:17:23.080
<i>drives away reality and laughter.</i>

00:17:21.480 --> 00:17:23.600
Maria, focus on using the staff

00:17:23.080 --> 00:17:24.870
<i>The more I long for it,</i>

00:17:23.600 --> 00:17:26.010
to open the Treasury again!

00:17:24.870 --> 00:17:28.150
<i>the more I slip through this dazzling light.</i>

00:17:26.010 --> 00:17:26.730
What?

00:17:26.730 --> 00:17:28.150
If we can open it externally,

00:17:28.430 --> 00:17:30.860
we should be able to open it from the inside.

00:17:29.060 --> 00:17:33.240
<i>Instead of choosing to be alone, to protect peace,</i>

00:17:31.120 --> 00:17:33.240
That thing is a key!

00:17:34.020 --> 00:17:41.490
<i>I want to feel the warmth of a hand 
I can never know on my own!</i>

00:17:35.740 --> 00:17:38.150
Serena!

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:42.380
Get out!

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:46.610
<i>A melody of life I offer to you alone,</i>

00:17:42.380 --> 00:17:44.300
Before the Nephilim escapes!

00:17:46.610 --> 00:17:51.710
<i>the prelude to eternity forming a beautiful rainbow.</i>

00:17:47.610 --> 00:17:49.130
Let's go, Yukine!

00:17:49.850 --> 00:17:50.760
Right!

00:17:51.710 --> 00:17:56.770
<i>No one can steal this vow in my heart.</i>

00:17:56.770 --> 00:18:00.090
<i>Let's take flight, voices in harmony.</i>

00:18:00.090 --> 00:18:05.200
<i>The sky is waiting!</i>

00:18:01.010 --> 00:18:02.960
Looks like there's no way around.

00:18:02.960 --> 00:18:04.850
Then there's only one path.

00:18:04.850 --> 00:18:06.070
Let's hold hands!

00:18:11.310 --> 00:18:12.300
Maria...

00:18:12.300 --> 00:18:13.210
Maria-san.

00:18:21.400 --> 00:18:24.540
I will not easily let go of these hands!

00:18:26.160 --> 00:18:29.600
The fastest, shortest route...

00:18:48.380 --> 00:18:51.690
...is a straight line!

00:19:08.460 --> 00:19:12.240
<i>Loneliness becomes gentleness...</i>

00:19:12.240 --> 00:19:24.070
<i>Scars become proof that strong bonds were formed!</i>

00:19:12.650 --> 00:19:15.590
The staff... We need to close the gate...

00:19:15.590 --> 00:19:18.100
The Nephilim is about to explode!

00:19:19.010 --> 00:19:20.210
It's not over yet.

00:19:20.680 --> 00:19:23.470
We have other strong friends...

00:19:24.070 --> 00:19:25.220
Friends?

00:19:24.750 --> 00:19:29.980
<i>A melody of life I offer to you alone,</i>

00:19:26.420 --> 00:19:29.660
My best friend...

00:19:29.980 --> 00:19:32.230
<i>Hibiki taught me that there are</i>

00:19:29.980 --> 00:19:34.930
<i>the prelude to eternity forming a beautiful rainbow.</i>

00:19:32.230 --> 00:19:34.360
<i>other ways to fight than Gears.</i>

00:19:34.360 --> 00:19:36.730
I'm going to fight, too!

00:19:34.930 --> 00:19:39.930
<i>There is no end to this song in my heart.</i>

00:19:38.030 --> 00:19:40.780
Please! Close!

00:19:39.930 --> 00:19:43.320
<i>Let's take flight, voices in harmony.</i>

00:19:43.320 --> 00:19:47.310
<i>The sky is waiting!</i>

00:19:43.660 --> 00:19:47.310
Make a world where Hibiki...

00:19:47.310 --> 00:19:49.040
Where no one has to fight!

00:19:47.310 --> 00:19:55.420
<i>Now unleash everything we have!</i>

00:20:19.280 --> 00:20:20.740
It's wrong,

00:20:20.740 --> 00:20:23.860
a world that doesn't need heroes.

00:20:25.980 --> 00:20:29.520
The Moon is returning to its proper orbit.

00:20:30.890 --> 00:20:33.910
But we've lost contact with Dr. Nastassja.

00:20:44.350 --> 00:20:46.660
<i>Mom saved the future for us...</i>

00:20:49.110 --> 00:20:51.420
Thank you, Mother.

00:20:51.790 --> 00:20:52.810
Maria-san?

00:20:59.670 --> 00:21:02.360
Gungnir belongs to you.

00:21:05.410 --> 00:21:06.170
But...

00:21:06.740 --> 00:21:09.310
We reactivated the lunar ruins.

00:21:10.150 --> 00:21:11.740
The Curse of Balal?

00:21:11.740 --> 00:21:15.820
So humanity's mutual understanding 
has gotten further away again?

00:21:17.970 --> 00:21:20.300
It's fine. Everything's okay!

00:21:24.090 --> 00:21:27.510
Because there are songs in this world!

00:21:28.110 --> 00:21:29.250
Hibiki!

00:21:32.580 --> 00:21:34.250
Songs?

00:21:35.650 --> 00:21:37.770
Sometime, people will be connected.

00:21:38.090 --> 00:21:40.840
But that isn't some other place.

00:21:40.840 --> 00:21:42.400
Or some far future.

00:21:43.090 --> 00:21:45.030
We shared it just now.

00:21:47.150 --> 00:21:48.460
Tachibana Hibiki,

00:21:49.830 --> 00:21:51.910
I'm glad I met you.

00:22:02.950 --> 00:22:06.820
<i>Can you hear it? 
The passionate music I perform?</i>

00:22:06.820 --> 00:22:09.540
<i>In the sky? Unleash it!</i>

00:22:09.540 --> 00:22:13.370
<i>Can you hear the pulse of life's beginning?</i>

00:22:13.370 --> 00:22:16.260
<i>Of love? Spur it on!</i>

00:22:16.260 --> 00:22:16.940
<i>Far away...</i>

00:22:17.020 --> 00:22:17.810
<i>Far away...</i>

00:22:17.810 --> 00:22:21.850
<i>On that day, a star became music.</i>

00:22:21.850 --> 00:22:24.270
<i>The wind laughed and cried,</i>

00:22:24.270 --> 00:22:29.440
<i>and soon turned its heartbeat into a song.</i>

00:22:29.440 --> 00:22:32.040
<i>And then, our dream opened</i>

00:22:32.040 --> 00:22:37.310
<i>to a world we'd never seen!</i>

00:22:37.570 --> 00:22:40.680
<i>Yes, just believe.</i>

00:22:40.680 --> 00:22:43.310
<i>Let's make history</i>

00:22:43.310 --> 00:22:46.630
<i>with a light even God doesn't know.</i>

00:22:46.630 --> 00:22:50.200
<i>Undying flames illuminate the future.</i>

00:22:50.200 --> 00:22:52.850
<i>Won't you fly with me?</i>

00:22:52.850 --> 00:22:56.330
<i>Just feeling feathers, wet with tears.</i>

00:22:56.330 --> 00:23:00.120
<i>On days that your wings are 
too heavy to fly, wish!</i>

00:23:00.120 --> 00:23:03.390
<i>And I'll put within your right hand</i>

00:23:03.390 --> 00:23:07.650
<i>the power to dream!</i>

00:23:07.650 --> 00:23:10.740
<i>We can flap our wings like birds.</i>

00:23:10.740 --> 00:23:14.140
<i>Singing heart!</i>

00:23:14.140 --> 00:23:21.800
<i>The rainbow tells us that our 
dreams are always with us!</i>

00:23:38.930 --> 00:23:40.940
Tsubasa-san! Chris-chan!

00:23:42.640 --> 00:23:44.190
Listen to this, Tachibana...

00:23:44.410 --> 00:23:48.900
She won't call me "senpai" anymore.

00:23:48.900 --> 00:23:50.200
I said...

00:23:50.620 --> 00:23:52.010
What? What?

00:23:52.010 --> 00:23:55.420
You call Tsubasa-san "senpai"?

00:23:55.420 --> 00:23:57.330
Hey, Hibiki!

00:23:57.330 --> 00:24:00.460
This is a good chance to tell you something...

00:24:00.460 --> 00:24:04.210
I'm older than you, and I'm your senpai!

00:24:05.050 --> 00:24:06.670
Let me at her!

00:24:06.670 --> 00:24:08.610
That's enough, you two.

00:24:08.610 --> 00:24:11.090
Your wounds aren't even healed yet.

00:24:12.310 --> 00:24:13.610
Hey, Hibiki...

00:24:14.110 --> 00:24:15.520
Are you okay?

00:24:15.520 --> 00:24:16.970
Do you feel strange?

00:24:16.970 --> 00:24:19.540
You're so worried!

00:24:20.570 --> 00:24:23.000
They said the relic that was eating away

00:24:23.000 --> 00:24:25.980
at me disappeared completely back then.

00:24:26.340 --> 00:24:27.590
Hibiki...

00:24:27.960 --> 00:24:28.850
But you know...

00:24:30.280 --> 00:24:33.100
The Gungnir in my chest is gone,

00:24:33.650 --> 00:24:36.040
but I'll never lose the song Kanade-san

00:24:36.040 --> 00:24:38.370
entrusted to me.

00:24:46.980 --> 00:24:50.130
And I'm not the only one.

00:24:56.270 --> 00:24:57.700
I'm sure that song

00:24:59.490 --> 00:25:02.460
is in everyone's hearts.

00:25:08.770 --> 00:25:13.020
<b>Fin</b>
